  },
  {
    "chinese": "每一个伟大的主角都体现了人类某种无法调和的内在冲突。",
    "english": "Every great protagonist embodies some irreconcilable inner conflict of humanity.",
    "soundmark": "/ˈevri ɡreɪt prəˈtæɡənɪst ɪmˈbɒdɪz sʌm ɪˈrekənˈsaɪləbl ˈɪnə ˈkɒnflɪkt əv hjuːˈmænɪti/",
